WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.700
This is DataLens. Drop a dataset, and get answers in seconds.

2
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:21.367
The moment a file lands, every column is profiled in your browser. In the sample orders file, it finds forty duplicate IDs, missing ratings, and a column that mixes numbers and text.

3
00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:32.100
The overview scores data quality across completeness, validity, uniqueness and consistency, and writes the key insights in plain English.

4
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:40.167
Charts are chosen from the column types, and a SQL console and one-click cleaning are a tab away.

5
00:00:40.767 --> 00:00:47.700
That's DataLens, built by Aditya Malviya. Try it live, at the link below.
